            "detailed_description": "<strong>Form of a Legend</strong> is a real time strategy game set in a fantasy world about building and managing your civilization. You start as a group of villagers from the civilization you choose and explore the map to find special places, tribes to conquer, develop your technologies.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play against the AI or your friends.</strong></h2><br>Add aggressive AI or pacific AI in single player or play with your friends online!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/extras/d094c87112904f2c41a475655d1cb4f4.avif?t=1620297028\" width=600 height=160 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Develop your civilization</strong></h2><br>Build, gather resources and research technologies. Then train armies of warriors and magicians and attack! Or fortify your city with walls to protect your economy.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Choose your path to become a Legend</strong></h2><br>Train an army and conquer the world or build a market to make trade routes and bring people to your Plaza through <strong>fairs</strong> that way you will control the economy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/726550/extras/37be3d01bd04d37632673a063e036bdd.avif?t=1620297028\" width=600 height=160 /></span>",
